      "created_at": "2024-08-13T14:17:32.649Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s that time of year again</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/gen-con-live-2024\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/gen-con-live-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/gen-con-live-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Gen Con LIVE 2024!</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Welcome to another live show, this one featuring live real trumpet playing by Trevor!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:31:13 A noir-style episode! We had costumes, the afore-mentioned trumpet-playing Trevor, cool(?) accents, and even a smoke machine!  There...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Video version</p><div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"BvOz29fnrZs\" data-video-title=\"Letters Page: Live from Gen Con 2024\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BvOz29fnrZs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b0c66add60c99cb8b680b479e2fff704cbf53289.jpeg\" title=\"Letters Page: Live from Gen Con 2024\" data-dominant-color=\"555951\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n",
