    {
      "id": 260227,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-08-13T16:09:46.669Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Man, there’s something about hearing that little bit of crowd murmur at the start of a live show that really makes it.</p>\n<p>Also, what the hell is this intro XD</p>\n<p>Bolumbo? XD The voice thing is just wonderful. So sad Adam ended up with con crud!</p>\n<p>The jazz version of the theme song is stellar. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> I really have to wonder how it was to be in a panel in an adjoining room at this time, the live music coming through the walls.</p>\n<p>Aeturnus’ secret weapon is torment! Torment and consuming things! …Two secret weapons!</p>\n<p>Okay, I need Haka shaking hands with the Grimace now, it will definitely cure my depression 100%</p>\n<p>Gee, all this time, who knew he was just Baron Daddy Issues? :V</p>\n<p>Being bubble wrapped comes with cookies? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\"> Time to suffer grievous bodily injury!</p>\n<p>Also yay, Christopher can never be harmed again! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> And now I need to watch the video for the parts I couldn’t see!</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-08-13T16:09:46.669Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
