      "raw": "Man, there's something about hearing that little bit of crowd murmur at the start of a live show that really makes it.\n\nAlso, what the hell is this intro XD\n\nBolumbo? XD The voice thing is just wonderful. So sad Adam ended up with con crud!\n\nThe jazz version of the theme song is stellar. :) I really have to wonder how it was to be in a panel in an adjoining room at this time, the live music coming through the walls.\n\nAeturnus' secret weapon is torment! Torment and consuming things! ...Two secret weapons!\n\nOkay, I need Haka shaking hands with the Grimace now, it will definitely cure my depression 100%\n\nGee, all this time, who knew he was just Baron Daddy Issues? :V\n\nBeing bubble wrapped comes with cookies? :eyes: Time to suffer grievous bodily injury!\n\nAlso yay, Christopher can never be harmed again! :D And now I need to watch the video for the parts I couldn't see!",
