      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-08-15T23:45:07.423Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I actually had the same thought, that Adam looked better in this particular getup.</p>\n<p>I tried to put my finger on why, and I think it’s that basically Christopher just is not blue-collar-looking enough. It’s why he, as you say, looks more like a vampire without the hat.</p>\n<p>Christopher’s stylistic/sartorial place in a noir story is either as the criminal kingpin or the grey market pawn shop owner/fence/knowledge broker the detective gets info from.</p>",
