      "id": 260267,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-08-16T22:38:01.824Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s my (EE) Hatch costume. Hence the ID card held up over the shoulder of that guy in the robe. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"> (Who is that, again? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smirk.png?v=12\" title=\":smirk:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smirk:\">)</p>\n<p>Comically, it’s easier to tell when you see the back of the shirt (as Christopher noted when I turned around at one point and he saw it <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rofl.png?v=12\" title=\":rofl:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rofl:\">). (I had two shirts and two cards made, just in case I need them, but it also lets me take pics of both sides of them.)</p>\n<p>I forgot to take my mask and lanyard off for that pic, unfortunately. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/pensive.png?v=12\" title=\":pensive:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":pensive:\"></p>\n<p>Pictures of the ID card (with the red and black back that matches the EE art) and the shirt (the back with the prison details and the name tag on the front).<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912\" title=\"IMG_20240816_180602547_BURST001_TOP\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912_2_375x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20240816_180602547_BURST001_TOP\" data-base62-sha1=\"mojnv0x5JdHwPL4V2edECdMKiqe\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912_2_375x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912_2_562x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912_2_750x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9cef6430d05e01d9a2b2e866d1e9d75d21ad0912_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_20240816_180602547_BURST001_TOP</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2560 286 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47\" title=\"IMG_20240816_180500141\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47_2_666x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20240816_180500141\" data-base62-sha1=\"8ACqgAmwgC8NtNZR6iOQjT6aigL\" width=\"666\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47_2_666x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47_2_999x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47_2_1332x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3c351ab38d0e5b80bf8e8feefdb5a0f94d6a0e47_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_20240816_180500141</span