      "created_at": "2024-08-17T18:58:49.520Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"31014\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Christopher’s stylistic/sartorial place in a noir story is either as the criminal kingpin or the grey market pawn shop owner/fence/knowledge broker the detective gets info from.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>or the Fed that turns out to be a friend after spending much of the story as an antagonist.</p>",
